# About Crossyword

Crossyword is a daily crossword puzzle game for the Gemini protocol.

## Author

Created by Alan Velasco (alanbato) for the Gemini community

## Source Code

=> https://github.com/alanbato/crossyword GitHub Repository

Issues and Contributions welcome.

## Built With

* Python - Programming language
* Xitzin - Gemini protocol application framework
* SQLModel - Database ORM
* Jinja2 - Template engine
* puz - Crossword puzzle file parser

## The Gemini Protocol

Gemini is a lightweight internet protocol designed for simplicity and privacy. It sits between Gopher and the Web in terms of complexity, focusing on text-based content without tracking or JavaScript.

=> gemini://geminiprotocol.net/ Learn more about Gemini

